                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;This issue was created by maloo for Andreas Dilger &amp;lt;andreas.dilger@intel.com&amp;gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;This issue relates to the following test suite run: &lt;a href="http://maloo.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3499839c-9e43-11e3-98dd-52540035b04c" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;http://maloo.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3499839c-9e43-11e3-98dd-52540035b04c&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It was run for the &lt;a href="https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-3336" title="LFSCK II: MDT-OST OST orphan handling" class="issue-link" data-issue-key="LU-3336"&gt;&lt;del&gt;LU-3336&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; patch &lt;a href="http://review.whamcloud.com/8305" class="external-link" target="_blank" rel="nofollow noopener"&gt;http://review.whamcloud.com/8305&lt;/a&gt; so there is some chance this is a regression in that patch.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_222a failed with the following error in the test output:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AGL for ls failed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The sub-test test_223 failed with the following error in the test output:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;reenqueue failed&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;

&lt;p&gt;There is nothing interesting in the dmesg logs.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Info required for matching: sanity 222a&lt;/p&gt;
</description>
